{"timestamp":"2026-06-25T13:45:12.611Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"最新日志说明现在已经好了。\n\n前面的 `Exec format error` 是旧状态：当时 `/usr/share/systemd/aditof-server` 被上次中断安装截成了空文件，所以 systemd 执行时报：\n\n```text\nFailed at step EXEC spawning /usr/share/systemd/aditof-server: Exec format error\n```\n\n后面这几行才是修复后的最新状态：\n\n```text\nJun 25 21:44:49 aditof systemd[1]: Started Network server service.\nJun 25 21:44:49 aditof aditof-server[8457]: Server built with websockets version:3.1.0\nJun 25 21:44:49 aditof aditof-server[8457]: Server patch marker: rk3588-tof-getframe-watchdog-20260625\nJun 25 21:44:49 aditof aditof-server[8457]: Creating Vhost 'default' port 5000\n```\n\n这证明：\n\n- `aditof-server` 已经不是空文件。\n- systemd 能正常启动它。\n- 运行的是带 watchdog 修改的新版本。\n- 现在不要启动 `network-gadget.path`，避免 USB 触发影响 SSH。\n\n下一步就是保持当前 service 运行，然后从 RK3588 端跑 GUI 复测，同时在相机端看日志：\n\n```bash\nsudo journalctl -u network-gadget.service -f -o short-precise\n```\n\n复测时应该能看到 `GetFrame: waitForBuffer begin` 等阶段日志。","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
