{"timestamp":"2026-06-25T13:47:05.049Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"在 RK3588 上做两件事：开相机端日志采集，然后跑 GUI 复测。不要去重启相机端 USB/network-gadget。\n\n**1. 开一个终端抓相机日志**\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /home/linaro/rk3588_tof/camera-logs\n\nlog=/home/linaro/rk3588_tof/camera-logs/camera_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).log\n\nssh -tt analog@10.42.0.1 \\\n  'sudo journalctl -u network-gadget.service -f -o short-precise' \\\n  2>&1 | tee \"$log\"\n```\n\n这个窗口保持开着。\n\n**2. 另开一个终端跑 GUI 调试**\n\n```bash\ncd /home/linaro/rk3588_tof\n./ToF/scripts/debug_tof_gui.sh\n```\n\nGUI 里连接相机、开始取流，等它复现或稳定运行一段时间。\n\n**3. 复测时看日志重点**\n\n相机日志里应该出现：\n\n```text\nServer patch marker: rk3588-tof-getframe-watchdog-20260625\nGetFrame: waitForBuffer begin\nGetFrame: VIDIOC_DQBUF begin\nGetFrame: getInternalBuffer begin\nGetFrame: VIDIOC_QBUF begin\nGetFrame completed in ...\n```\n\n如果又卡住，把这三个路径发我：\n\n```text\n/home/linaro/rk3588_tof/camera-logs/最新camera日志\n/home/linaro/rk3588_tof/ToF/build/examples/tof-viewer/debug-runs/最新crash目录\n/home/linaro/rk3588_tof/ToF/build/examples/tof-viewer/log/最新log_xxx.txt\n```\n\n如果只是想快速确认 server 通不通，也可以先在 RK3588 上跑：\n\n```bash\nnc -vz 10.42.0.1 5000\n```","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
