{"timestamp":"2026-06-27T07:37:07.523Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"检查完了。当前相机端“文件配置”是好的，但服务没有运行。\n\n已确认正常的部分：\n\n```text\n/ 是 /dev/mmcblk1p2 ext4\n/usr/share/systemd/aditof-server 和 build 产物哈希一致\naditof-server 包含 rk3588-tof-getframe-watchdog-20260625\nldd 没有 not found\n/etc/ld.so.conf.d/aditof.conf 已配置\n```\n\n`network-gadget.service` 当前配置也符合你“不想影响 USB/SSH”的要求：\n\n```ini\nExecStart=/usr/share/systemd/aditof-server\nRestart=on-failure\n```\n\n没有 `ExecStartPre=/usr/share/systemd/tof-power-en.sh`，所以启动 server 不会先跑相机上电脚本去动 USB。\n\n当前 systemd 状态：\n\n```text\nnetwork-gadget.service: disabled, inactive\nnetwork-gadget.path: disabled, inactive\naditof-server not running\n```\n\n结论：相机端已经准备好，但你还没有启动 server。下一步如果要复测，在相机端手动启动一次：\n\n```bash\nsudo systemctl start network-gadget.service\nsudo journalctl -u network-gadget.service -b -n 80 --no-pager\n```\n\n不要启动 `network-gadget.path`，这样不会因为 USB path 触发影响 SSH 稳定性。","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
