{"timestamp":"2026-06-27T08:56:58.579Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"在相机端开一个 SSH 窗口，执行这个：\n\n```bash\nsudo bash -c '\n: > /var/log/tof-live.log\njournalctl -b -f -o short-precise |\nwhile IFS= read -r line; do\n  printf \"%s\\n\" \"$line\" >> /var/log/tof-live.log\n  sync -f /var/log/tof-live.log 2>/dev/null || sync\ndone\n'\n```\n\n说明：\n\n- `: > /var/log/tof-live.log` 会先清空旧日志，避免和上次混在一起。\n- 这个窗口要一直开着，不要关。\n- 然后你去 RK3588 跑 GUI 复测。\n\n如果你不想清空旧日志，用追加版：\n\n```bash\nsudo bash -c '\njournalctl -b -f -o short-precise |\nwhile IFS= read -r line; do\n  printf \"%s\\n\" \"$line\" >> /var/log/tof-live.log\n  sync -f /var/log/tof-live.log 2>/dev/null || sync\ndone\n'\n```\n\n复测断开后回来查：\n\n```bash\nsudo tail -n 300 /var/log/tof-live.log\n```","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
