t.service 当时没启动；现在已经恢复。\n\n  接下来复测时，先在相机板上开持久日志：\n\n  sudo journalctl -b -f -o short-precise | sudo tee -a /var/log/tof-live.log\n\n  然后 RK3588 端跑 GUI。若再断，回来直接看：\n\n  sudo tail -n 300 /var/log/tof-live.log\n  sudo journalctl -u network-gadget.service -b -n 200 --no-pager\n\n  这次新 server 如果进入取帧，会看到：\n\n  GetFrame: waitForBuffer begin\n  GetFrame: VIDIOC_DQBUF begin\n  GetFrame: getInternalBuffer begin\n  GetFrame: VIDIOC_QBUF begin\n\n  如果卡超过 8 秒，应该看到 watchdog 退出并由 systemd 重启。\n\n\n› analog@aditof:~$ sudo tail -n 300 /var/log/tof-live.log\n  [sudo] password for analog:\n  -- Logs begin at Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST. --\n  Jun 27 15:37:20.118941 aditof sudo[2931]: pam_unix(sudo:session): session opened for user root by (uid=0)\n  Jun 27 15:37:21.810564 aditof sudo[2931]: pam_unix(sudo:session): session closed for user root\n  Jun 27 15:37:54.355814 aditof sshd[3139]: Accepted password for analog from 10.42.0.103 port 37716 ssh2\n  Jun 27 15:37:54.360961 aditof sshd[3139]: pam_unix(sshd:session): session opened for user analog by (uid=0)\n  Jun 27 15:37:54.368889 aditof systemd-logind[379]: New session 5 of user analog.\n  Jun 27 15:37:54.370732 aditof systemd[1]: Started Session 5 of user analog.\n  Jun 27 15:37:56.168029 aditof sudo[3152]:   analog : TTY=pts/2 ; PWD=/home/analog ; USER=root ; COMMAND=/usr/bin/\n  journalctl -b -f -o short-precise\n  Jun 27 15:37:56.168794 aditof sudo[3153]:   analog : TTY=pts/2 ; PWD=/home/analog ; USER=root ; COMMAND=/usr/bin/tee -a /\n  var/log/tof-live.log\n  Jun 27 15:37:56.169410 aditof sudo[3152]: pam_unix(sudo:session): session opened for user root by analog(uid=0)\n  Jun 27 15:37:56.170246 aditof sudo[3153]: pam_unix(sudo:session): session opened for user root by analog(uid=0)\n  -- Logs begin at Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST. --\n  Mar 15 23:08:50.077620 aditof kernel: mx8-img-md: created link [adsd3500 1-0038] => [mxc-mipi-csi2.0]\n  Mar 15 23:08:50.077717 aditof kernel: mxc-md 32c00000.bus:camera: mxc_md_create_links\n  Mar