3.679016   518 server.cpp:618] GetFrame: VIDIOC_QBUF\n  begin\n  Mar 15 23:10:43.679620 aditof aditof-server[518]: I20230315 23:10:43.679229   518 server.cpp:169] GetFrame completed in\n  36 ms, frame length: 1310720\n  Mar 15 23:10:43.739091 aditof aditof-server[518]: I20230315 23:10:43.738934   518 server.cpp:401] GetFrame function\n  Mar 15 23:10:43.739425 aditof aditof-server[518]: I20230315 23:10:43.739099   518 server.cpp:570] GetFrame: waitForBuffer\n  begin\n  Mar 15 23:10:43.766645 aditof aditof-server[518]: I20230315 23:10:43.766399   518 server.cpp:580] GetFrame: VIDIOC_DQBUF\n  begin\n  Mar 15 23:10:43.766645 aditof aditof-server[518]: I20230315 23:10:43.766572   518 server.cpp:590] GetFrame:\n  getInternalBuffer begin\n  Mar 15 23:10:43.779358 aditof aditof-server[518]: I2analog@aditof:~$ sudo journalctl -u network-gadget.service -b -n 200\n  --no-pager\n  -- Logs begin at Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST, end at Sat 2026-06-27 15:37:56 CST. --\n  -- No entries --\n  analog@aditof:~$\n\n\n• 你现在看的两个东西不是同一个来源：\n\n  - /var/log/tof-live.log 是之前 tee -a 追加保存下来的文件，里面可能包含上一次 SSH 连接断开前抓到的日志。\n  - journalctl -u network-gadget.service -b 是“当前这次启动”的 systemd journal。它显示 -- No entries --，说明当前 boot 里\n    network-gadget.service 没启动过，或者你已经重启到了新 boot。\n\n  从 tof-live.log 里能看到一个重要线索：新 server 已经跑起来，并且成功取了多帧。最后可见的一帧停在：\n\n  GetFrame: waitForBuffer begin\n  GetFrame: VIDIOC_DQBUF begin\n  GetFrame: getInternalBuffer begin\n\n  后面没有看到：\n\n  GetFrame: VIDIOC_QBUF begin\n  GetFrame completed\n\n  所以这次很可能卡在 getInternalBuffer() 或日志断开前刚好没写完。要确认，需要看“上一次 boot”的 journal。\n\n  在相机板上执行：\n\n  sudo journalctl --list-boots\n\n  然后看上一次启动，例如：\n\n  sudo journalctl -b -1 -u network-gadget.service --no-pager\n  sudo journalctl -b -1 --no-pager | grep -E 'aditof-server|GetFrame|watchdog|blocked|network-gadget|kernel panic|reboot|\n  Failed|error'\n\n  如果 -1 没有内容，再试：\n\n  sudo journalctl -b -2 -u network-gadget.service --no-pager\n  sudo journalctl -b -2 --no-pager | grep -E 'aditof-server|GetFrame|watchdog|blocked|network-gadget|kernel panic|reboot|\n  Failed|error'\n\n  另外当前 boot 先查服务是否启用：\n\n  systemctl is-enabled network-gadget.path\n  systemctl is-active network-gadget.path\n  systemctl is-active network-gadget.service\n\n  如果当前 boot 没启动服务，重新启动：\n\n  sudo systemctl start network-gadget.service\n  sudo journalctl -u network-gadget.service -b -n 80 --no-pager\n\n  把 journalctl --list-boots 和 -b -1 的关键输出贴出来，才能确认最后到底是卡在 getInternalBuffer()、触发 watchdog 重启，还是\n  整板直接重启导致日志没来得及落盘。\n\n\n› analog@aditof:~$ sudo journalctl --list-boots\n  -7 421d671281d447f89586705dfd719dbd Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST—Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST\n  -6 128945c5a0a24ec4be06eea6ee583969 Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST—Wed 2023-03-15 23:06:54 CST\n  -5 a9d2f1d710204b82bac1d7078bdd830f Wed 2023-03-15 23:06:54 CST—Wed 2023-03-15 23:10:01 CST\n  -4 e3b5c7d740b442cc8a9861786d7dc45b Wed 2023-03-15 23:10:01 CST—Wed 2023-03-15 23:10:01 CST\n  -3 b1dedfe0946d474fb93c890d22bfa04b Wed 2023-03-15 23:10:02 CST—Wed 2023-03-15 23:10:43 CST\n  -2 a3a32145bd0947559fbf92cd2866f494 Wed 2023-03-15 23:10:55 CST—Sat 2026-06-27 12:30:55 CST\n  -1 3c4b5c09a974438bb7d300530d05e147 Sat 2026-06-27 15:15:00 CST—Sat 2026-06-27 15:15:28 CST\n   0 1f5e2e2082ba44e891038d1ba641fc7e Sat 2026-06-27 15:30:00 CST—Sat 2026-06-27 15:37:56 CST\n  analog@aditof:~$ sudo journalctl -b -1 -u network-gadget.service --no-pager\n  -- Logs begin at Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST, end at Sat 2026-06-27 15:37:56 CST. --\n  -- No entries --\n  analog@aditof:~$ sudo journalctl -b -1 --no-pager | grep -E 'aditof-server|GetFrame|watchdog|blocked|network-gadget|\n  kernel panic|reboot|\n  >   Failed|error'\n  -- Logs begin at Wed 2023-03-15 23:04:16 CST, end at Sat 2026-06-27 15:37:56 CST. --\n  Mar 15 23:04:16 aditof kernel: Booting Linux on physical CPU 0x0000000000 [0x410fd034]\n  Mar 15 23:04:16 aditof kernel: Linux version 5.10.72-adi-00051-g581d0847b21a (root@abadki-d01) (aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc\n  (Ubuntu/Linaro 7.5.0-3ubuntu1~18.04) 7.5.0,