{"timestamp":"2026-06-27T07:34:35.480Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"已改好并生效。\n\n我把 `/home/analog/Workspace/ToF/sdk/src/connections/target/adsd3500_sensor.cpp` 里的额外 V4L2 buffer 从 `3` 改成了 `0`，所以现在 `SetFrameType` 会请求：\n\n```text\nm_capturesPerFrame + EXTRA_BUFFERS_COUNT = 1 + 0 = 1\n```\n\n也就是只申请 1 个 buffer，用来验证是否避开上次卡住的：\n\n```text\nVIDIOC_QUERYBUF begin, bufferIndex=1\n```\n\n已重新编译，服务也已重启：\n\n```text\nnetwork-gadget.service: active\nnetwork-gadget.path: inactive\naditof-server PID: 1177\n```\n\n没有启动 `network-gadget.path`。\n\n现在你可以重新开日志：\n\n```bash\nsudo bash -c '\n: > /var/log/tof-live.log\njournalctl -b -f -o short-precise |\nwhile IFS= read -r line; do\n  printf \"%s\\n\" \"$line\" >> /var/log/tof-live.log\n  sync -f /var/log/tof-live.log 2>/dev/null || sync\ndone\n'\n```\n\n然后 RK3588 端跑 GUI。复现后回来执行：\n\n```bash\nsudo tail -n 300 /var/log/tof-live.log\n```\n\n这次重点看 `setFrameType: VIDIOC_REQBUFS allocate begin` 里 `requested count` 应该是 `1`。如果还能继续走到 `Start/GetFrame`，说明之前很可能就是第二个 buffer 的 `VIDIOC_QUERYBUF` 触发驱动侧卡死。","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
