{"timestamp":"2026-06-27T07:33:56.447Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"改好了，也已经重新编译并重启服务。\n\n当前状态：\n\n```text\nnetwork-gadget.service: active\nnetwork-gadget.path: inactive\naditof-server PID: 1113\n```\n\n这次补丁做了两件事：\n\n1. `EXTRA_BUFFERS_COUNT` 从 `3` 改成 `0`\n   所以后面如果走到 `VIDIOC_REQBUFS allocate begin`，应该看到 `requested count=1`。\n\n2. `setFrameType()` 增加了复用 fd 逻辑\n   如果状态是：\n\n```text\nstarted=0\nvideoBuffers=0\nnVideoBuffers=0\nfd/sfd 有效\n```\n\n就不再 close/reopen `/dev/video0` 和 `/dev/v4l-subdev1`，而是打印：\n\n```text\nsetFrameType: reuse open device without close/reopen\nsetFrameType: open skipped, reusing existing fds\n```\n\n这样就是专门绕开上次卡住的 `close(fd)` 后驱动 release 路径。\n\n编译产物也确认正常，不再是 0 字节：\n\n```text\nlibaditof.so.4.2.0: 9.0M\n```\n\n下一次复测前重新开日志，然后跑 GUI。重点看有没有出现：\n\n```text\nsetFrameType: reuse open device without close/reopen\nsetFrameType: open skipped, reusing existing fds\nsetFrameType: VIDIOC_REQBUFS allocate begin, requested count=1\n```","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
